Error [E0919]: `big` is too large for `#InlineAlways`
  --> tests/ui/inline_always_too_large.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | #InlineAlways fn big() -> Int {
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: its body has 44 statements — over the 40-statement ceiling `#InlineAlways` enforces so a promised inline doesn't quietly bloat every call site.
 Fix: drop `#InlineAlways` (use `#Inline` as a hint the compiler is free to ignore), or split the function so the hot part is small enough to inline.
